{"architectures":["arm64","x64","x86"],"id":"dnGrep.dnGrep","latestVersion":"5.0.80.0","media":{"icons":[{"mimeType":"image/png","path":"media/icon.4ee3451d.png","priority":1,"sha256":"4ee3451d2fd7ded49114d15ddbaaf7a78d270d0460bf132c4178ed196cc0548d","source":"winget-legacy"}],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"author":"dnGrep Community Contributors","copyright":"Copyright (C) 1989, 1991 Free Software Foundation, Inc.","copyrightUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dnGrep/dnGrep/master/license.txt","description":"dnGrep allows you to search across files with easy-to-read results.","license":"GPL-3.0","licenseUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dnGrep/dnGrep/master/license.txt","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"author":"dnGrep Community Contributors","copyright":"Copyright (C) 1989, 1991 Free Software Foundation, Inc.","copyrightUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dnGrep/dnGrep/master/license.txt","description":"dnGrep allows you to search across files with easy-to-read results.","license":"GPL-3.0","licenseUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dnGrep/dnGrep/master/license.txt","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"dnGrep allows you to search across files with easy-to-read results.\nSearch through text files, Word, Excel and PowerPoint documents, PDFs, and archives using text, regular expression, XPath, and phonetic queries. dnGrep includes search-and-replace, whole-file preview, right-click search in File Explorer, and much more.","moniker":"dngrep","name":"dnGREP","packageUrl":"https://dngrep.github.io/","publisher":"dnGrep Community Contributors","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/dnGrep/dnGrep/issues","publisherUrl":"https://dngrep.github.io/","releaseNotes":"v5.0.80.0\nChanges in this release:\n#1542 Replace log: Added a new log to show the before and after results of the replace operation, showing a full list of all the modified files. The log is shown in the main window while changes are accepted or rejected in the Replace dialog, and after the replace is committed. The log can be enabled or disabled using the \"Show replace log\" in the Search options section in the Options dialog. Thank-you to @DerellLicht for the contribution.\n#1546 Search in results: Made the \"Search in results\" checkbox on the main screen visible always and disabled or enabled based on the current search results, to make the feature more visible.\nRelease includes updates to\n.NET 10.0.15\n7Zip 26.06\nOther third-party library updates\nTranslations\nUpdated Translations to several other languages, thank-you for your contributions. Many languages need help to complete them. You are welcome and encouraged to complete or improve any of the existing translations, see Translate dnGrep for more information. Do as much or as little as you like, all help is welcome.\nThis program uses free code signing provided by SignPath.io, and a certificate by the SignPath Foundation.","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/dnGrep/dnGrep/releases/tag/v5.0.80.0","tags":["grep","search"]}},"longDescription":"dnGrep allows you to search across files with easy-to-read results.\nSearch through text files, Word, Excel and PowerPoint documents, PDFs, and archives using text, regular expression, XPath, and phonetic queries. dnGrep includes search-and-replace, whole-file preview, right-click search in File Explorer, and much more.","moniker":"dngrep","name":"dnGREP","packageUrl":"https://dngrep.github.io/","publisher":"dnGrep Community Contributors","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/dnGrep/dnGrep/issues","publisherUrl":"https://dngrep.github.io/","releaseNotes":"v5.0.80.0\nChanges in this release:\n#1542 Replace log: Added a new log to show the before and after results of the replace operation, showing a full list of all the modified files. The log is shown in the main window while changes are accepted or rejected in the Replace dialog, and after the replace is committed. The log can be enabled or disabled using the \"Show replace log\" in the Search options section in the Options dialog. Thank-you to @DerellLicht for the contribution.\n#1546 Search in results: Made the \"Search in results\" checkbox on the main screen visible always and disabled or enabled based on the current search results, to make the feature more visible.\nRelease includes updates to\n.NET 10.0.15\n7Zip 26.06\nOther third-party library updates\nTranslations\nUpdated Translations to several other languages, thank-you for your contributions. Many languages need help to complete them. You are welcome and encouraged to complete or improve any of the existing translations, see Translate dnGrep for more information. Do as much or as little as you like, all help is welcome.\nThis program uses free code signing provided by SignPath.io, and a certificate by the SignPath Foundation.","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/dnGrep/dnGrep/releases/tag/v5.0.80.0","tags":["grep","search"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["arm64","x64","x86"],"detailPath":"versions/5.0.80.0/app.json","detailSha256":"4c3773bd015ab8dffe6c17029d3c3e72aa8d6a5f9946442676870998e8f17ef3","releaseDate":"2026-11-11","releaseDateSource":"commit","version":"5.0.80.0"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64","x86"],"detailPath":"versions/5.0.65.0/app.json","detailSha256":"0af5dc6e9f2890acf6cd4b2e7e565abfa07f024ae44b1d193d087a3e2c753988","releaseDate":"2026-10-13","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"5.0.65.0"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64","x86"],"detailPath":"versions/5.0.57.0/app.json","detailSha256":"03139457e839b3b2e8e5ef5a2698694327b1a96d09f45f82b8bb213e8e6d1a14","releaseDate":"2026-09-09","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"5.0.57.0"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64","x86"],"detailPath":"versions/5.0.49.0/app.json","detailSha256":"a56223947b283eed0e0f3e698b5fe6aff6f2627dd93cc521a4ea35034f4e3d38","releaseDate":"2026-08-11","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"5.0.49.0"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64","x86"],"detailPath":"versions/5.